        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Deltana DSH45U, 4-1/2\" x 4-1/2\" x Square Corners Single Action Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with One Single Action Spring Door Hinge, Allen Wrench, Adjusting Pin, Locking Pin plus #12 x 1-1/4\" Wood Screws and #12- x 1/2\" Machine Screws. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors. Available in 10 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Allen Wrench Tool is used to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pin holds the Spring in tension after it is set. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSH45U-specifications.gif?v=1704354672\" width=\"552\" height=\"251\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSH45U Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4-1/2 Inch Spring Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Corners</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.134\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed, Fire Rated: R19063 UL Listed Door Closer Body 57YM</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSH45U.pdf?v=1704262172\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSH45U Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different finishes for this Hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Durable Steel.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
